Error [E0003]: selective imports aren't part of Jet
  --> tests/ui/std_selective_import.jet:1:18
    |
  1 | import core.math { clamp };
    |                  ^
 Why: modules keep their namespace so call sites show where a library function comes from
 Fix: import the module with `as`, then call items through the alias: `import core.math as math; math.clamp(x, lo, hi);`
